  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n +\n -\n ×\n /\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ×\n /\n +\n -\n \n \n\n**So, checking each option one by one:**\n\nOption 1) 10 × 5 / 2 = 13 ⇒ 10 + 5 - 2 = 13\n\n⇒ __**10 + 5**__ - 2 = 13\n\n⇒ __**15 - 2**__ = 13\n\n⇒ **13 = 13 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) 8 - 4 × 2 = 6 ⇒ 8 / 4 + 2 = 6\n\n⇒ __**8 / 4**__ + 2 = 6\n\n⇒ __**2 + 2**__ = 6\n\n⇒ 4 ≠ 6 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 6 / 2 - 3 = 5 ⇒ 6 - 2 / 3 = 5\n\n⇒ 6 - __**2 / 3**__ = 5\n\n⇒ __**6 - 0.67**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 5.33 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 12 + 2 - 4 = 10 ⇒ 12 × 2 / 4 = 10\n\n⇒ 12 × __**2 / 4**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __**12 ×**____** 0.5**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 6 ≠ 10 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
